WEBVTT

00:08:29.836 --> 00:08:34.356
we must all include the principle
of doing no harm

00:08:34.356 --> 00:08:40.476
in all decisions, big and small,
for all present and future actions,

00:08:40.516 --> 00:08:45.516
and put the health
of our planet and ours first.

00:08:46.556 --> 00:08:47.756
Thank you.

00:08:47.796 --> 00:08:52.556
(Applause)